    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1156">

                <pb facs="0859" n="783" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg783"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.115R39/1</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to Special Representative Rodgers
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-07-14T17:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 14, 1916, 5 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>202. Richardson Construction Company reports Governor, Sonora, has designated
                    company enemy to Constitutionalist cause and has appointed Mexican administrator
                    company’s large interests Yaqui Valley.</p>
                <p>Request that Governor be ordered state immediately grounds his action and purpose
                    appointment of administrator.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
